Plumbline
=========

This repository offers tested patches against published FLOP npm packages
for two open client/SDK issues filed by @almondous:

  https://github.com/flop-labs/network/issues/321
  https://github.com/flop-labs/network/issues/44

The TypeScript sources for those packages live in the private repository
flop-labs/flop-core (sdk/client and sdk/typescript). They are not publicly
readable, so this is a standalone package plus patches against the npm
releases, not a fork of flop-core.

Credits
-------

@almondous diagnosed both defects against the published artifacts, wrote
the minimal patches, and published complete offline harnesses on the
issues above. The patch files and harnesses in this repository are those
proposals, arranged so they can be re-run against pinned npm tarballs.

